-- Movement Controller (Fly / Noclip / WalkSpeed)
-- Improved: safer anti-detection attempts, fixed metatable hook usage, replaced deprecated Draggable,
-- slider safety/clamping, safer remote blocking (pcall), and improved GUI close behavior.

